        "text": "{{note 1.2}}, {{note 1.3}} and {{note 1.4}} are the b3, root and b7 of {{chord 1}}. With the same rhythm over {{chord 2}} the motif plays the b7, 5th and 3rd, and over {{chord 3}} it starts on the 3rd and ends on the 7th. Every long note is a chord tone, so each statement spells its chord clearly."
      },
      {
        "topic": "tensions",
