        ],
        "text": "{{note 3.3}} is the same pitch as the middle note of the first two statements. It was the root of {{chord 1}} and the 5th of {{chord 2}}; over {{chord 3}} it becomes the 9th, a soft colour. The motif keeps its middle note and simply hears it in a new way."
      },
      {
